// Lexical weight stays 64 unless the host sets it.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE weight ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank   ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG weight rank

IMPULSE weight 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "weight" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
